 style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: Lat=
o, Tahoma, sans-serif;">Being an entrepreneur is like being a kid in a cand=
y store.</span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">There=E2=80=99s always something new, shiny, and =
exciting calling out to you. For me, that=E2=80=99s the future=E2=80=94drea=
ming up new features, crazy growth hacks, or even whole new businesses. The=
 future is where the fun is! Everything shiny feels brighter than the work =
I=E2=80=99m doing today.</span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">But here=E2=80=99s the kicker: if you chase every=
 shiny thing, you=E2=80=99ll end up going in circles.</span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">That=E2=80=99s why the ultimate superpower of an =
entrepreneur is being the NoMan (or NoWoman, let=E2=80=99s be fair).</span>=
</p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">Every single day, I have to fight the urge to say=
 yes to all the ideas that pop into my head. Nope, not today, new project. =
Sorry, thrilling side quest. Even when my brain is doing cartwheels, scream=
ing, =E2=80=9CThis one=E2=80=99s different! This is the one!=E2=80=9D I hav=
e to stick to my guns and focus.</span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">The hardest =E2=80=9Cno=E2=80=9D I ever gave wasn=
=E2=80=99t to a coworker or a friend. It was to myself. Telling my own brai=
n, =E2=80=9CNo, buddy, not today,=E2=80=9D felt like grounding an overexcit=
ed puppy. Painful, but necessary.</span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">And here=E2=80=99s the twist: that big fat =E2=80=
=9Cno=E2=80=9D turned out to be freeing. It cleared the way to focus on wha=
t actually mattered=E2=80=94and that=E2=80=99s when the magic happens.</spa=
n></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">So, to anyone out there chasing big dreams: remem=
ber, saying no isn=E2=80=99t giving up. It=E2=80=99s doubling down on what=
=E2=80=99s most important. Sometimes, the most powerful =E2=80=9Cyes=E2=80=
=9D hides behind a very firm =E2=80=9Cno.=E2=80=9D</span></p></div></div></=
